\newlabel{fig:shaper-transfer}{{10}{9}{Left: the slope falls from 0.94 to 0.71 to 0.26 as the branches turn on, tracking the ideal sine. Right: the pointed triangle (orange) becomes the shaped wave (purple), which is close to the ideal sine (dotted)}{figure.caption.10}{}}
